\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Woy[ daa nkwa abodoo; w'as[m se:
\par Nea ogye me di no w] daa nkwa.
\par Enti wo mma fi w]n k]m mu sr[ s[:
